@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Products
	Frontend testing for the www products

Teardown:
	* I teardown the following downloaded files
	| liferay-dxp-osgi-7.4.13.u15-20220308132215444.zip |

Scenario: Download liferay DXP 30 days free trial
    End users should be able to download 30 days free trial of liferay dxp via 30 day trial.

    Given I go to the www page with the relative url "products/dxp/30-day-trial"
	And I should be able to view the 30 day trial page and form
	And I request a download of Liferay DXP 30 day free trial with the following values
	| Work Email      | usr.liferaydxp1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Country         | United States                         |  
	| State/Territory | California                            |
	| Download Type   | OSGI Dependencies                     |
	| First Name      | USR                                   |
	| Last Name       | LiferayDXP1                           |
	| Company         | Usrdxp                                |
	| Phone           | 555-555-5678                          |
	# Necessary pause for the download to complete
	And I wait for "3" minutes
    And I should see the downloaded file "liferay-dxp-osgi-7.4.13.u30-20220622162231380.zip"
	And the current url content should contain the text "products/dxp/30-day-trial/thank-you"

Scenario: Download liferay DXP 30 days free trial via 30 day trial footer link
    End users should be able to download 30 days free trial of liferay dxp via 30 day trial footer link.

    Given I click on the footer "30 Day Trial" link under the "Platform" footer category
	And I should be able to view the 30 day trial page and form
	And I request a download of Liferay DXP 30 day free trial with the following values
	| Work Email      | usr.liferaydxp1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Country         | United States                         |  
	| State/Territory | California                            |
	| Download Type   | OSGI Dependencies                     |
	| First Name      | USR                                   |
	| Last Name       | LiferayDXP1                           |
	| Company         | Usrdxp                                |
	| Phone           | 555-555-5678                          |
	# Necessary pause for the download to complete
	And I wait for "3" minutes
    And I should see the downloaded file "liferay-dxp-osgi-7.4.13.u30-20220622162231380.zip"
	And the current url content should contain the text "products/dxp/30-day-trial/thank-you"

Scenario: View DXP section video
	End users should be able to view section video in the DXP page.

	Given I go to the www page with the relative url "products/dxp"
	Then I should be able to watch the section video

Scenario: View DXP top navigation links
	End users should be able to view top navigation links in the DXP page.

	Given I go to the www page with the relative url "products/dxp"
	And I click on the "What's New" link on the top navigation
	Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com/products/dxp/new"
	When I go to the www page with the relative url "products/dxp"
	And I click on the "Manage" link on the top navigation
	Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com/products/dxp/manage"
	When I go to the www page with the relative url "products/dxp"
	And I click on the "Experience" link on the top navigation
	Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com/products/dxp/experience"
	When I go to the www page with the relative url "products/dxp"
	And I click on the "Commerce" link on the top navigation
	Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com/products/dxp/commerce"
	When I go to the www page with the relative url "products/dxp"
	And I click on the "Architecture" link on the top navigation
	Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com/products/dxp/architecture"

Scenario: View renew trial page and request a sales consultation 
	End users should be able to view the renew trial page and request a sales consultation.

	Given I go to the www page with the relative url "products/dxp/30-day-trial"
	And I click on the renew your trial license here link under 30 day trial download form
	Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should contain the text "www.liferay.com/products/dxp/30-day-trial/next-steps"
	When I go to the www page with the relative url "products/dxp/30-day-trial/next-steps"
	And I accept all cookies
	Then I should be able to view the request a sales consultation form
	And I request a sales consultation with the following values
	| Work Email            | usr.liferaydxp1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Country               | United States                         |  
	| State/Territory       | California                            |
	| Whats your challenge? | Increasing B2B online revenue         |
	| First Name            | USR                                   |
	| Last Name             | LiferayDXP1                           |
	| Company               | Usrdxp                                |
	| Phone                 | 555-555-5678                          |
	| Industry              | Technology                            |
	| Company Revenue       | $1 million - $10 million              |
	| Department            | Engineering/IT                        |
	| Job Role              | Developer/Engineer                    |
	| Company Size          | 5,001 - 10,000                        |
	| Job Title             | Engineering                           |
	# Necessary pause for the form sent message to happen
	And I wait for "1" minutes
	Then I should be able to view a message stating that the sales consultation form was sent